            "summary": "Business services providers play a critical role for enterprises, assisting them with everything from new hardware integrations to consulting and marketing. Still, investors are uneasy as firms face challenges from AI-driven disruptors and tightening corporate budgets. These doubts have certainly contributed to services stocks\u2019 recent underperformance - over the past six months, the industry\u2019s 2.3% gain has fallen behind the S&P 500\u2019s 9.9% rise.",
